<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle at standstill - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle at standstill - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was at a standstill in the panhandle area Friday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested. Feedlots reporting light inquiry. No sales confirmed following weekly movement of 97,300 head.</p>
<p>Confirmed - None  Week Ago - None   Year Ago - 3,200</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
